<!-- 公共 4 步智能推荐半屏弹窗（首次登录引导 & 训练库/首页智能推荐共用） -->
<modal-sheet
  visible="{{visible}}"
  showConfirm="{{false}}"
  showCancel="{{false}}"
  bind:close="onClose"
>
  <!-- 步骤指示器 -->
  <view class="wizard-progress">
    <view class="wizard-dots">
      <view
        wx:for="{{4}}"
        wx:key="index"
        class="wizard-dot {{recommendStep > index ? 'done' : ''}} {{recommendStep === index + 1 ? 'active' : ''}}"
      />
    </view>
    <text class="wizard-step-text">第 {{recommendStep}} / 4 步</text>
  </view>

  <!-- 步骤1：健身目标 -->
  <view wx:if="{{recommendStep === 1}}" class="wizard-step">
    <view class="wizard-header">
      <text class="wizard-title">你的健身目标是什么？</text>
      <text class="wizard-subtitle">我们会根据你的目标推荐最适合的计划</text>
    </view>
    <view class="wizard-options wizard-goal-options">
      <view
        wx:for="{{wizardGoals}}"
        wx:key="id"
        class="wizard-option wizard-goal-card {{wizardSelectedGoal === item.id ? 'selected' : ''}}"
        bindtap="onSelectGoal"
        data-id="{{item.id}}"
      >
        <text class="wizard-option-name">{{item.name}}</text>
        <text class="wizard-option-desc">{{item.desc}}</text>
        <view wx:if="{{wizardSelectedGoal === item.id}}" class="wizard-option-check">✓</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="wizard-skip-row" bindtap="onClose">
      <text class="wizard-skip-text">暂不使用推荐</text>
    </view>
    <view class="wizard-footer">
      <view class="wizard-btn wizard-btn-primary" bindtap="onNext">下一步</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 步骤2：训练天数 -->
  <view wx:if="{{recommendStep === 2}}" class="wizard-step">
    <view class="wizard-header">
      <text class="wizard-title">每周能练几天？</text>
      <text class="wizard-subtitle">选择你每周可以稳定投入训练的天数</text>
    </view>
    <view class="wizard-days-grid">
      <view
        wx:for="{{wizardDayOptions}}"
        wx:key="days"
        class="wizard-day-card {{wizardSelectedDays === item.days ? 'selected' : ''}}"
        bindtap="onSelectDays"
        data-days="{{item.days}}"
      >
        <text class="wizard-day-num">{{item.days}}</text>
        <text class="wizard-day-label">天</text>
        <text class="wizard-day-desc">{{item.desc}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="wizard-skip-row" bindtap="onClose">
      <text class="wizard-skip-text">暂不使用推荐</text>
    </view>
    <view class="wizard-footer">
      <view class="wizard-btn wizard-btn-ghost" bindtap="onPrev">上一步</view>
      <view class="wizard-btn wizard-btn-primary" bindtap="onNext">下一步</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 步骤3：训练经验 -->
  <view wx:if="{{recommendStep === 3}}" class="wizard-step">
    <view class="wizard-header">
      <text class="wizard-title">你的训练经验？</text>
      <text class="wizard-subtitle">帮助我们为你匹配适合的计划难度</text>
    </view>
    <scroll-view scroll-y class="wizard-exp-scroll" show-scrollbar="{{false}}">
      <view class="wizard-options wizard-exp-options">
        <view
          wx:for="{{wizardExpOptions}}"
          wx:key="id"
          class="wizard-option wizard-exp-card {{wizardSelectedExp === item.id ? 'selected' : ''}}"
          bindtap="onSelectExp"
          data-id="{{item.id}}"
        >
          <view class="wizard-exp-header">
            <view class="wizard-option-info">
              <text class="wizard-option-name">{{item.name}}</text>
              <text class="wizard-exp-tag">{{item.tag}}</text>
            </view>
          </view>
          <text class="wizard-option-desc">{{item.desc}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </scroll-view>
    <view class="wizard-skip-row" bindtap="onClose">
      <text class="wizard-skip-text">暂不使用推荐</text>
    </view>
    <view class="wizard-footer">
      <view class="wizard-btn wizard-btn-ghost" bindtap="onPrev">上一步</view>
      <view class="wizard-btn wizard-btn-primary" bindtap="onNext">下一步</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 步骤4：推荐计划 -->
  <view wx:if="{{recommendStep === 4}}" class="wizard-step">
    <view class="wizard-header">
      <text class="wizard-title">为你推荐</text>
      <text class="wizard-subtitle">基于你的目标和训练偏好，为你推荐最适合的计划</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{wizardRecommended.length === 0}}" class="wizard-empty">
      <text class="wizard-empty-text">暂无符合条件的推荐计划</text>
    </view>
    <scroll-view wx:else scroll-y class="wizard-recommend-scroll" show-scrollbar="{{false}}">
      <view class="wizard-recommend-list">
        <view
          wx:for="{{wizardRecommended}}"
          wx:key="id"
          class="wizard-recommend-card {{wizardSelectedPlan === item.id ? 'selected' : ''}}"
          bindtap="onSelectPlan"
          data-id="{{item.id}}"
        >
          <view class="wizard-recommend-header">
            <text class="wizard-recommend-name">{{item.name}}</text>
            <view class="wizard-recommend-tags">
              <text class="tag {{item.difficultyClass}}">{{item.difficulty}}</text>
              <text class="tag tag-gray">{{item.training_days}}天/周</text>
            </view>
          </view>
          <text class="wizard-recommend-desc">{{item.description}}</text>
          <view class="wizard-recommend-features">
            <text wx:for="{{item.features}}" wx:for-item="feat" wx:key="*this" class="feature-tag">{{feat}}</text>
          </view>
          <view wx:if="{{wizardSelectedPlan === item.id}}" class="wizard-recommend-check">✓ 已选择</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </scroll-view>
    <view class="wizard-skip-row" bindtap="onClose">
      <text class="wizard-skip-text">暂不使用推荐</text>
    </view>
    <view class="wizard-footer">
      <view class="wizard-btn wizard-btn-ghost" bindtap="onPrev">上一步</view>
      <view wx:if="{{wizardRecommended.length === 0}}" class="wizard-btn wizard-btn-primary" bindtap="onClose">关闭</view>
      <view wx:else class="wizard-btn wizard-btn-primary {{!wizardSelectedPlan ? 'disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="onApply">应用推荐</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</modal-sheet>
